  "bio": "Jos Knevels is an accomplished tattoo artist known for their exceptional skill in various styles, including realism, trash polka, black & gray, and cover-up tattoos. Their attention to detail and proficiency ensure every piece of ink they work on is crafted with precision, resulting in exquisite and life-like designs. As the owner of Fantasy Tattoo JNK, Jos maintains the highest standards of professionalism in their work, creating a trusted and sought-after name in the tattooing community.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nOwner @fantasy_tattoojn\n\nOwner @fantasy_tattoojn",
